WEBVTT

00:11:57.337 --> 00:12:03.135
to change how Harris County
deals with fossil fuels.

00:12:03.135 --> 00:12:07.473
You know, she believes
that the energy capital of the world

00:12:07.514 --> 00:12:11.935
can also become the renewable energy
capital of the world.

00:12:11.977 --> 00:12:13.771
And I've seen in the last month

00:12:13.812 --> 00:12:19.026
how a big difference my new climate PAC
is having on down ballot races

00:12:19.026 --> 00:12:20.944
like Luke's and Lina's.

00:12:20.944 --> 00:12:23.155
And this is what thrills me.

00:12:23.197 --> 00:12:24.740
This is what gives me hope.

00:12:24.782 --> 00:12:28.869
I believe the most important thing
that I've ever done is creating this PAC,

00:12:28.869 --> 00:12:31.622
and it's what I'm going
to continue to do till I die.